Comix extension port

Derived from Keiyoushi extensions-source, Comix 1.6.54:
https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source/tree/24bd7e69e54020079298d19bf808ccc0961b0a69/src/en/comix

site_api.js and chapter_pages.js are unchanged assets from that release's JAR.
../src/client.js adapts its initial-data extraction.
