harvest_browse.js is adapted from revision
4ba2c82725ce999b818c10b5fc10617fd2800d6b:
https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source/tree/4ba2c82725ce999b818c10b5fc10617fd2800d6b/src/en/comix/assets
It recognizes explicit empty results and reports loading failures.
The current adapter reads rendered chapter rows and reader images instead of
private API objects, and checks that every reader page has been collected.
